Package: distCUSUM
Type: Package
Title: Distance-based CUSUM statistics for high dimensional change points
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Lupeng Zhang and Reza Drikvandi
Maintainer: Lupeng Zhang <lupengzhang9746@gmail.com>
Description: Implements the distance-based CUSUM method of Zhang and
    Drikvandi (2025) <doi:10.1007/s11222-025-10752-1> for detecting single
    and multiple change points in high dimensional data. Multiple change
    points are detected using recursive binary segmentation. The modified
    L1 norm is used by default, with support for other distance functions.
    Also provides the test statistic, distance matrix and CUSUM matrix,
    together with the S&P500 and MIT cellphone data sets analyzed in the paper.
License: GPL-3
URL: https://github.com/lupengzhang/distCUSUM
BugReports: https://github.com/lupengzhang/distCUSUM/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
Imports:
    stats
Suggests:
    MASS
